**WATCH THIS WALKTHROUGH FIRST — before doing anything else, watch the Navigating Notion page below.**
<page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3a3e923a64e280df8c6cdc2c53f23710">Navigating Notion (Watch First)</page>
<callout icon="👋" color="yellow_bg">
	**Welcome to the team! 👋**<br>Everything you need to operate is in this workspace. Learn it cold. Your performance depends on it.**<br><br>IMPORTANT LINKS:**<br>• Slack: [thegridmbe.slack.com](https://thegridmbe.slack.com/)<br>• Free Discord (send prospects / community): [discord.gg/mbe](https://discord.gg/mbe)<br>• Book-a-call funnel: [mbemultiaccounting.com/apply](https://mbemultiaccounting.com/apply)<br>• Payment Links: [docs.google.com/sheets](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1TPYAZ5espdlWIIdc8vP2B0m0RbfEt9Je-oe1cQrYKps/edit?usp=sharing)**<br>**• Intake Form: [docs.google.com/form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1N4PojWCWvsq_GSVvABpQLVV9qiwSIhBumh9UIy03L9g/viewform?edit_requested=true)**<br><br>DAILY FORMS (submit every single day you work):**<br>• BOD (start of day, BEFORE your first dial/DM): [Sales Rep BOD form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSerd7CiWJycaf5P_eyFjkofqNy_0xBdm4EQzJLM17JvY0CBkg/viewform)<br>• Setter EOD: [Setter EOD form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1eVH2l8hdObyVtmgmVCGOFWYrGI7DZhxejVAGKGiwRA4/viewform)<br>• DM Setter EOD: [DM Setter EOD form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSckZ5cXYqvAvZIxkw0LZBMyaJyipUjcTy6KR1Y6Z3v_vl9Rmg/viewform)<br>• Closer EOD: [Closer EOD form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1-fJjTqBYjdWLfLPEvRLbn2rHEdPv3h1D1vHIr0HosoM/viewform)<br>• Post-Call Notes (Closer): [Post-Call Notes / EOC](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1S2YqKusAGk9cY6dXYKhaZgSYGr1K-1hiXLl84AXfsIA/viewform)<br>• New Deal (on every close): [New Deal Log](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1SnSkeMjO_0Oh7VddJDjrXxYki9LBhC3-MWGIHOymZn0/viewform)
</callout>
